    "",
    "The sweep is reproduced with",
    "  python -m vanir.parse_sweep --language=kotlin \\",
    "      --source_root=<project> --output=<file.json>",
    "The eight projects are the ones of the spec Phase 1: SystemUI, Settings,",
    "PackageInstaller, Launcher3, Permission, IntentResolver, HealthFitness",
    "and MediaProvider. They are the current main of their repositories at the",
    "time of the sweep.",
    "",
    "The baseline of the spec (134 of 137 files, 2,009 functions) is over the",
    "FIXED files of the fixes, not over the eight whole projects, so the two",
    "numbers are NOT comparable.",
    "",
    "The files that did not parse are listed with the errors of the grammar.",
    "They are the limits of the tree-sitter-kotlin grammar 1.1.0, not of the",
    "Vanir parser. The largest group is an annotated internal constructor,",
    "e.g. an @Inject or an @AssistedInject in front of an internal",
    "constructor. The others are suspend used as an identifier, a comment as",
    "the last expression of a lambda, and a few further constructs the",
    "grammar does not accept."
